  "question": "求函数 $f(x) = \\frac{x}{x^2 - 5x + 4}$ 在 $x = 5$ 处的幂级数.",
  "answer": "发散，所以",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "收敛半径与收敛域",
    "幂级数展开"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 将分母做因式分解，分式拆分为两个部分分式之和再展开."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} \\frac {x}{x ^ {2} - 5 x + 4} & = \\frac {x}{(x - 4) (x - 1)} = \\frac {x}{3} \\left(\\frac {1}{x - 4} - \\frac {1}{x - 1}\\right) \\\\ & = \\frac {(x - 5) + 5}{3} \\left[ \\frac {1}{1 + (x - 5)} - \\frac {1}{4 + (x - 5)} \\right] \\\\ & = \\frac {5 + (x - 5)}{3} \\left[ \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} (x - 5) ^ {n} - \\frac {1}{4} \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} \\left(\\frac {x - 5}{4}\\right) ^ {n} \\right] \\\\ & = \\frac {5 + (x - 5)}{3} \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} \\left(1 - \\frac {1}{4 ^ {n + 1}}\\right) (x - 5) ^ {n} \\\\ & = \\frac {5}{4} + \\frac {1}{3} \\sum_ {n = 1} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} \\left(4 - \\frac {1}{4 ^ {n + 1}}\\right) (x - 5) ^ {n}. \\end{array}\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "上式成立的范围为 $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} |x - 5| < 1 \\\\ \\frac{|x - 5|}{4} < 1 \\end{array} \\right. \\Rightarrow |x - 5| < 1$ ，收敛区间为 $4 < x < 6$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "当 $x = 4,6$ 时，级数均发散，所以"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "$$\nf (x) = \\frac {5}{4} + \\frac {1}{3} \\sum_ {n = 1} ^ {\\infty} (- 1) ^ {n} \\left(4 - \\frac {1}{4 ^ {n + 1}}\\right) (x - 5) ^ {n}, \\quad 4 <   x <   6.\n$$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "发散，所以",
    "techniques_used": [
      "收敛半径与收敛域",
      "幂级数展开"
    ]
  },
